{"product_id":"vaporesso-gen-fit-pod-kit","title":"Vaporesso GEN FIT Pod Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Vaporesso Gen Fit vape kit is an easy to use MTL (Mouth To Lung) vape that is ideal for new and experienced vapers. The Gen Fit kit has a built-in 1200mAh battery and a USB-C charging port, meaning the kit's battery lasts longer and recharges quickly. There are 3 adjustable power levels, and the Gen Fit \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-kenya\" title=\"Vape Kit Kenya\"\u003evape kit\u003c\/a\u003e will produce 8 - 12W or power for an MTL (Mouth To Lung) vape. This kit also includes the iTank M and a 1.2 Ohm MTX coil, meaning it's ready to vape as soon as you get it.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1200mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Filling Tank\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2ml Capacity Tank\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInhale Or Button Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePulse Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis kit can either be inhale activated by puffing on the mouthpiece, or you can use the fire button to power the tank. The Gen Fit kit delivers improved taste with Vaporesso's Axon chipset. By using pulse mode, flavour production is boosted, resulting in a more consistent vape. It delivers an MTL vape that feels closer to a cigarette and will create small amounts of vapour. You can adjust the wattage to suit, simply hit the power button 3 times to switch power modes between low, medium, and high.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe Gen Fit vape kit includes the iTank M, which easily fills from the top and can hold up to 2ml of e-liquid. The tank comes with one 1.2 Ohm MTX coil that's pre-installed for easy set-up. It's best paired with e-liquids that are 50% PG or higher. You can take even more control over your vape with its easily adjustable airflow, which allows you to choose a looser or tighter vape.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBox Contains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaporesso GEN Fit Mod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-itank-m\" title=\"Vaporesso iTank M Tank\"\u003eVaporesso iTank M Tank\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaporesso MTX 1.2 Ohm Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB-C Charging Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUser Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775202762807,"sku":"V Gen FIT Pod Kit","price":5850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso-gen-fit-kit-min.jpg?v=1752511392","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-gen-fit-pod-kit","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




